A Markdown file with CRLF line endings still has its frontmatter read and its headings outlined, with no `\r` left in the output.
== args
input/crlf.md
== file input/crlf.md escaped
---\r
description: CRLF doc\r
---\r
# Title\r
\r
## Section\r
== stdout
input/crlf.md (6 lines)
description: "CRLF doc"
[L4-L6] # Title
[L6-L6] ## Section
